Epi Info 7 reference output (fixtures/ei7/oswego.html, oswego.json)
===================================================================

Produced by .github/workflows/ei7.yml on windows-latest, never by hand:
the workflow downloads the pinned official Epi Info 7.2.7.0 release ZIP

  https://github.com/Epi-Info/Epi-Info-Community-Edition/releases/download/7.2.7.0/2025.3.9.Epi.Info.7.2.7.0.signed.dual.keys.en-US.es-ES.fr-FR.pt-BR.zip
  SHA-256 8440a628a28fd1c1993ebc8211fe0104fdb2572ae8bcb3427e07baceb08df609

verifies its SHA-256, reads the Sample.mdb bundled inside it as table
Oswego12 (75 rows), runs fixtures/ei7/oswego.pgm headless through
Analysis.exe, and extracts every labelled number with
fixtures/ei7/parse.mjs into oswego.json. oswego.html and oswego.json are
committed byte-for-byte from the workflow artifact of the run recorded
in oswego.json's source.run_url.

